  CVE-2026-5288|2026-04-01T05:16:02.343|2026-04-01T16:41:09.713|9.6|CRITICAL|CWE-416|N/A|false|Use after free in WebView in Google Chrome on Android prior to 146.0.7680.178 allowed a remote attacker who had compromised the renderer process to potentially perform a sandbox escape via a crafted HTML page. (Chromium security severity: High)|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-5288|0.00058|0.18093|6.7217
  CVE-2026-5287|2026-04-01T05:16:02.213|2026-04-02T00:16:24.977|8.8|HIGH|CWE-416|N/A|false|Use after free in PDF in Google Chrome prior to 146.0.7680.178 allowed a remote attacker to execute arbitrary code inside a sandbox via a crafted PDF file. (Chromium security severity: High)|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-5287|0.00074|0.22381|6.1622
